  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A grateful sovereign dragon has rewarded you with a shred of its power.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> You must have performed a service for a mythic sovereign dragon.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When an opponent strikes you in combat, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus on your next attack against that opponent. You can only receive this bonus against a single opponent in any given round. If you are hit by multiple opoonents in a gven round, you may choose the opponent against whom this benefit applies.</p>\n<p><strong>Mythic:</strong> When an opponent strikes you in combat, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus on your next attack against that opponent. In a given round, you can gain this bonus against a total number of opponents equal to your mythic tier. If you expend one use of mythic power, you can strike an opponent that just hit you as an immediate action, applying the bonus to attack to this roll.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/additional-non-mythic-feats#toc4\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
